<section class="hol-body hol-creature-sheet hol-summon-sheet">
<header class="hol-banner"><p class="hol-kicker">Summoned energy form · {{system.eligibility}}</p><h1>{{actor.name}}</h1><p>CV {{system.cv}} · Read-only source reference</p></header>
<p class="hol-note"><strong>Automation pending:</strong> command, spawning, controller linkage, tether, disappearance and specialty handlers. Importing this profile creates a reference Actor only.</p>
<section aria-label="Summon restrictions"><h2>Command and survival restrictions</h2><p>{{system.commandSource}}</p><p>{{system.healingSource}}</p><p>Conditions and durations use the controller's turn. No independent turns or summon chains. Tether uses nearest occupied squares; six squares is permitted. Lifecycle enforcement remains pending.</p></section>
<section aria-label="Printed statistics"><h2>Printed statistics</h2>
<dl class="hol-stat-grid"><div><dt>HP</dt><dd>{{system.health.value}} / {{system.health.max}}</dd></div><div><dt>Speed</dt><dd>{{system.speedSource}}</dd></div><div><dt>Footprint</dt><dd>{{system.footprint.width}} × {{system.footprint.height}}</dd></div><div><dt>Defense modifier</dt><dd>{{defenseLabel}}</dd></div><div><dt>Stability</dt><dd>{{system.stabilitySource}}</dd></div>{{#each attributes}}<div><dt>{{label}}</dt><dd>{{value}}</dd></div>{{/each}}</dl>
<p><strong>Resistance:</strong> {{system.resistances.sourceText}}</p><p><strong>Weakness:</strong> {{system.weaknesses.sourceText}}</p><p><strong>Condition immunities:</strong> {{#each system.immunities}}{{this}} · {{else}}None{{/each}}</p><p><strong>Senses:</strong> {{system.senses}}</p><p><strong>Communication:</strong> {{system.communication}}</p></section>
<section aria-label="Basic Melee attacker outcomes"><h2>Basic Melee · attacker outcomes</h2><p>{{system.basicMelee.attribute}} · {{attackLabel}} · one adjacent target · Physical damage</p><dl class="hol-outcome-grid"><div><dt>Weak attack</dt><dd>{{system.basicMelee.weak}}</dd></div><div><dt>Standard attack</dt><dd>{{system.basicMelee.standard}}</dd></div><div><dt>Strong attack</dt><dd>{{system.basicMelee.strong}}</dd></div></dl></section>
<section class="hol-creature-reference"><h2>Complete pinned profile</h2><div class="hol-item-reference">{{{referenceHTML}}}</div></section>
<p class="hol-reference-source">{{catalogId}} · {{sourcePath}} at <code>{{sourceCommit}}</code>. Distribution licensing remains undecided.</p>
</section>
